## 6. AI Provider Architecture

### 6.1 Provider Interface (`packages/ai/src/provider.ts`)
```typescript
export interface AIProvider {
  readonly metadata: ProviderMetadata;
  generate(request: ProviderRequest): Promise<ProviderResponse>;
  countTokens(text: string): Promise<number>;
  close(): Promise<void>;
}

export interface ProviderMetadata {
  name: string;           // "anthropic" | "openai" | "mock"
  isMock: boolean;
  model: string;
  contractVersion: string;
  maxTokens?: number;
  supportsStructuredOutput: boolean;
}
```

### 6.2 Structured Output Schema (`packages/ai/src/structuredOutput.ts`)
```typescript
// Zod schema for provider response validation
export const ProviderResponseSchema = z.object({
  answer: z.string(),
  reasoningTrace: z.array(z.string()).optional(),
  confidence: z.number().min(0).max(1).optional(),
  proposedActions: z.array(ProposedActionSchema).optional(),
  warnings: z.array(z.string()).optional(),
  isMock: z.boolean(),
  tokenUsage: z.object({
    inputTokens: z.number(),
    outputTokens: z.number(),
  }).optional(),
});
```

### 6.3 Anthropic Provider (`packages/ai/src/anthropicProvider.ts`)
- Uses `@anthropic-ai/sdk` with `tools` (function calling) for structured output
- Implements `generate()` with system prompt + context + tool definitions
- Maps tool calls → `ProposedAction[]`
- Token counting via `countTokens()` (approximation or Anthropic's token counting API)
- Timeouts: 30s connect, 120s response
- Retries: 3 attempts with exponential backoff (idempotent only)
- Fail-closed: throws on missing API key, never falls back silently

### 6.4 Provider Factory (`packages/ai/src/providerFactory.ts`)
```typescript
export function createProvider(config: ProviderConfig): AIProvider
export interface ProviderConfig {
  provider: 'anthropic' | 'openai' | 'mock';
  model: string;
  apiKey?: string;  // required for non-mock
  maxTokens?: number;
  timeoutMs?: number;
  maxRetries?: number;
}
```
- Reads from env: `AI_PROVIDER`, `AI_MODEL`, `AI_API_KEY`, `AI_MAX_TOKENS`, `AI_TIMEOUT_MS`, `AI_MAX_RETRIES`
- Validates config at startup; throws if real provider selected without API key

### 6.5 Orchestrator Integration
```typescript
// orchestrator.ts constructor
constructor(deps: OrchestratorDependencies & { providerFactory: ProviderFactory })
// processMessage()
const provider = this.providerFactory.create(this.config.providerConfig);
const response = await provider.generate(request);
// Track token usage in CoachingResponse + audit log
```

### 6.6 Cost Controls
| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Daily token budget | Rate limiter `ai_tokens_daily` counter per user |
| Per-request token limit | `maxTokens` in provider config + request validation |
| Model selection | Configurable via `AI_MODEL` env var |
| Usage logging | Token usage persisted in `CoachingResponse` + audit trail |

